  "raw_text": "Training-data contamination was identified as a threat to validity: a model may already know how a famous exoneration case ends. To reduce this, the National Registry of Exonerations, now at exonerationregistry.org, was chosen as a source of test cases. Its Recently Posted Cases list provides newer cases that likely fall outside the model's training data, allowing blind replays in which the model cannot rely on remembering the outcome.",
